<description>&lt;p&gt;Cameroon has received a Metal Shark patrol boat to strengthen maritime security as Boko Haram continues attacks, killing seven people in a village. Government forces are still targeting Anglophone separatist groups in the Northwest and Southwest regions. An explosion at a steel plant killed four people and seriously injured sixteen. Anti-femicide protests have taken place, reflecting broader social tensions. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPMFhlTDhVRWZZN0paYXlZZ09BeU9qdmNZd3dseDVYT0R1Q2I2Z0gwT211SEtzUXA4Q3Z3TDNSbGhnNWNKZlJST1hJc3hIT1FVdlY0dlFZcW9NRlBfYXU1UDFZQzE3MXBONkF2Tks4SUwyUWlPbHhWR3lNck9aMFFKNWdVZFVhU3dEUFczNXh3ZktpYnNzbU5YRnV3RVpSMjZKWXBZeHhGZk1oOXlsb0R1bHY5VVM4ZWRa?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE1POUwtYTAxdXliaU9qUjgzZXB3cllGbU1hRkM1S3JNUFpZVFhGVzB4YVl0clpoOXdVNWhrMzZhTEI0NzFmNDlFWWxfQkI2RGFOTkRac1lLekUwdk81eHY5S0JlTVBYNm9VSmN0Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNXzZLMTRMVTB1TEVLdDB6ek1FQ3cxSnVZdm4wUE1pbDFpcWYwdnplLVVPa0tmMWFzS19fVzYzb3AteG8yQTU5MkpGNkNOY0p3eGh4TjlUWmtVeklqWUY2aWlzUi1oc3UtMjByeTJ2VDZ0b1IteVZTZmxvUkFiQ0NnVm5MY0RQU0IwY2ZhcUNiWjZ5NkxoUjdMNDE4SjJ5VGdYbHNneVN0R3Q?oc=5&quot;&gt;CWB Chicago&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPSmhRWGphMW1mblhwY2lfQi01ZlZzTGxwM09pUVNuODlpSnpmMGQyZTZCQ1JvZHhQNHA1clVKdnBSU3VncHBLWjQxMXRQNml3V0lIX2NUMFpGWTRNczh3V2p0bW9XZDRhczN3U18ydl9XcE1mRm0zQW1RazdxWUF4c2R1WHZmWkFNa0pLYnZoS2hNaG9PQTNhVElQMjcydTRnNTNBUWtabWRWOGVSOXYxZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hawk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;